1
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:04,540
拿好 这是中毒抢救中心的电话
Okay, here's the number for poison control.

2
00:00:04,860 --> 00:00:05,320
找卡罗就行了
Ask for Carol.

3
00:00:05,680 --> 00:00:07,080
宝贝 我们没问题的
Honey, we're gonna be fine.

4
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:08,100
好好享受同学聚会去吧
Enjoy your reunion.

5
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:09,860
如果你能一起去的话就更好了
Oh, it'd be a lot more fun if you were there.

6
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:11,320
真抱歉我去不了
I really am sorry about that.

7
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:13,760
我不能错过和杰同队打保龄球的机会
I just can't miss the chance to bowl on Jay's team.

8
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:15,940
所以我才买了这双极速滑翔鞋
That's why I ordered these glide rights.

9
00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:18,400
只要你穿法正确 这双鞋能带给你
If you break'em in properly, they're supposed to give you

10
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:19,060
毫无阻力的滑行
a completely frictionless--

11
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:25,360
老实说 如果菲尔不去的话
If I'm being honest, the reunion might be a little more fun

12
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:26,400
同学聚会才会更好玩
if Phil isn't there.

13
00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:29,060
否则 我整个周末都得给他介绍谁是谁
Otherwise, I spend the whole weekend telling him who's who

14
00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:30,720
解释他听不懂的小圈子笑话
and explaining inside jokes.

15
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:32,760
如果我的时间都用来给他解释
And if all that explaining is going out,

16
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:35,000
就没时间喝酒了
the alcohol is not going in.

17
00:00:35,680 --> 00:00:38,000
妈 你走之前得签一下学校的这张表
Hey, mom. Before you go, you have to sign this for school.

18
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:39,800
不用看了 都是些套话
You don't have to read it. It's all boilerplate.

19
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:41,960
宝贝 我要迟到了 让你爸签吧
Honey, I am running really late. Ask your dad.

20
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:43,340
老爸在这儿呢
Right here, buddy.

21
00:00:43,340 --> 00:00:44,521
我擦
S--uhh!

22
00:00:44,540 --> 00:00:45,940
我得找家长签字
I have to get the letter signed

23
00:00:45,940 --> 00:00:48,280
是因为我的《美国革命战争》作业不合格
because I failed my assignment on the Revolutionary War.

24
00:00:48,920 --> 00:00:50,600
我重现了邦克山战役
I recreated the battle of Bunker Hill

25
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:52,280
用了以前的科学实验模型
using one of my old science projects.

26
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:54,100
在我看来这挺有"革命性"的啊
Seemed pretty revolutionary to me.

27
00:00:54,740 --> 00:00:57,340
勇敢的爱国者们攀登高山
The brave patriots made their way up the hillside,

28
00:00:57,340 --> 00:01:00,740
准备好了迎战狡诈的英国红衫军
prepared for whatever the devious Red Coats might inflict next.

29
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:02,340
这回你倒喷发了
Now you work?!

30
00:01:05,360 --> 00:01:06,920
-爸... -稍等 老弟
- So, dad... - One second, buddy.

31
00:01:07,420 --> 00:01:09,240
卖鞋的说 当你开始适应这种鞋
The salesman said when you're breaking these shoes in,

32
00:01:09,240 --> 00:01:10,920
左右移动会变得更容易
it's easier to move side to side.

33
00:01:11,860 --> 00:01:12,700
好家伙
Son of a gun.

34
00:01:13,300 --> 00:01:14,300
他说得对啊
He was right.

35
00:01:14,720 --> 00:01:15,560
要我签什么
What do we got here?

36
00:01:31,080 --> 00:01:33,220
我等这一天等了一年了
I've waited a year for this day--

37
00:01:33,460 --> 00:01:35,900
一年一度的同行工会保龄球锦标赛
The annual trade association scratch bowling tournament.

38
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:38,480
去年 我们输给了最强的对手
Last year, we lost to our biggest rival.

39
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:39,740
弗雷泽有劲敌阿里
Frazier had Ali.

40
00:01:40,560 --> 00:01:43,340
"普里契特衣柜队"有"衣柜衣柜衣柜衣柜队"
Pritchett's Closets has Closets, Closets, Closets, Closets.

41
00:01:43,840 --> 00:01:46,400
他们名字很傻 但球技不容小觑
It's a stupid name, but those cats can bowl.

42
00:01:47,222 --> 00:01:50,500
我就知道 你闻到煎饼味就会下来
Ay, I knew the pancakes would bring you down.

43
00:01:50,500 --> 00:01:51,980
今天只喝咖啡好了
Just coffee for me today.

44
00:01:52,126 --> 00:01:54,227
黑咖啡 正如我的心情一般黑暗
Black, like I feel on the inside.

45
00:01:54,227 --> 00:01:57,905
曼尼 拜托 只是一次试唱失败而已
Ay, Manny. Please, it was only one bad audition.

46
00:01:57,905 --> 00:02:00,100
不 是三次试唱失败
No, three bad auditions--

47
00:02:00,100 --> 00:02:01,580
秋季汇演 《歌剧魅影》
Fall Assembly, "Phantom,"

48
00:02:01,720 --> 00:02:02,700
以及这回的春季歌唱节
and now the Spring Sing.

49
00:02:03,300 --> 00:02:04,140
我弱爆了
I'm a disaster.

50
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:05,700
你总是这么夸张
You're always so dramatic.

51
00:02:05,980 --> 00:02:06,740
你说我夸张吗 妈妈
Dramatic, mother?

52
00:02:06,740 --> 00:02:08,740
我相信小卡今天就会打来
I am sure that Cam is gonna call you today

53
00:02:08,740 --> 00:02:09,660
把独唱部分安排给你的
and give you the solo.

54
00:02:09,780 --> 00:02:11,480
你对自己要求太严苛了
You're always so hard on yourself.

55
00:02:11,760 --> 00:02:14,900
还记得你说过你的脸型不适合戴帽子吗
Remember that you said that you didn't have a face for hats?

56
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:17,700
-结果呢 -我戴什么帽子都好看
- And? - I look great in every hat.

57
00:02:17,820 --> 00:02:18,840
我听不到
I can't hear you.

58
00:02:18,920 --> 00:02:20,420
我戴什么帽子都好看
I look great in every hat.

59
00:02:20,640 --> 00:02:22,400
趁好看的时候好好臭美吧
Well, enjoy that while it lasts.

60
00:02:22,540 --> 00:02:23,840
我曾以为自己戴帽子很好看
I had a pretty good hat run,

61
00:02:23,840 --> 00:02:26,320
但后来看到一张在农场度假时拍的照片
but then I saw a photo of myself from the dude ranch.

62
00:02:27,440 --> 00:02:28,520
看着就像格莱美上的瑞芭一样奇葩
I looked like Reba at the Grammys.

63
00:02:28,588 --> 00:02:29,969
看来你找到皮草了
I see that you found the fur.

64
00:02:29,969 --> 00:02:33,472
是的 对了 你有羽毛围脖吗
Yes. Uh, you wouldn't happen to have a feather boa, would you?

65
00:02:33,540 --> 00:02:34,960
你要在你们的奥斯卡派对上戴吗
Are you wearing that to your Oscar Party?

66
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:37,320
不是的 曼尼 我们才没那么俗气
No, Manny. We're not cliches.

67
00:02:37,320 --> 00:02:38,280
小卡在做派对布置
Cam's decorating the party

68
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:41,000
用莉莉打扮成各个明星的照片来...
with photos of Lily dressed as different starlets from the--

69
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:42,420
好吧 我们的确俗气
W-we--we're cliches.

70
00:02:42,420 --> 00:02:43,220
歌洛莉亚
Hey, Gloria,

71
00:02:43,820 --> 00:02:45,460
看我在保龄球包里找到了什么
look what I found in my bowling bag.

72
00:02:45,720 --> 00:02:47,800
去年锦标赛的二等奖
Second place prize in last year's tournament--

73
00:02:47,940 --> 00:02:48,880
免费水疗
A spa day.

74
00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:52,120
但过了今天就作废了
Oh, but it expires today.

75
00:02:52,180 --> 00:02:53,160
不好意思
Oh. Sorry.

76
00:02:53,160 --> 00:02:55,400
我真希望能用上
I just wish that I could use this.

77
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:56,900
但是今天保姆放假了
But today's the nanny's day off,

78
00:02:56,900 --> 00:02:58,360
我有一大堆的事情要做
and I have a million things to do.

79
00:02:58,480 --> 00:03:01,920
我得去买尿布 取婴儿车
I have to buy diapers, I have to go pick up the stroller,

80
00:03:02,260 --> 00:03:03,500
我还得去看医生
I have to go to the doctor.

81
00:03:04,180 --> 00:03:05,760
我真不想浪费掉 可是
I hate wasting this, but...

82
00:03:05,760 --> 00:03:08,480
我今天真的没时间
I just don't have any time today.

83
00:03:08,940 --> 00:03:11,280
是的 其实我很想去做水疗
Yes, I would have loved to go to the spa,

84
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:14,420
但自从我生了孩子
but having a baby has changed completely

85
00:03:14,420 --> 00:03:16,680
杰全家人对我的看法完全变了
the way that Jay's family look at me.

86
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:20,540
我不再是只会去做头发的歌洛莉亚
I am not anymore just Gloria that has her hair done,

87
00:03:20,760 --> 00:03:22,420
只会去健身的歌洛莉亚
Gloria that goes to the gym.

88
00:03:22,420 --> 00:03:24,600
现在我是新妈歌洛莉亚
Now I am Gloria the new mother--

89
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:27,111
让人惊呼"真不知她是如何办到的"的女人
the "I don't know how she does it" lady.

90
00:03:27,827 --> 00:03:29,248
如果羽毛围脖不在这儿
If the feather boa is not here,

91
00:03:29,248 --> 00:03:30,680
就是在我表妹那儿
it's at my cousin's.

92
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:33,220
等我看完医生买完药 去婴儿用品店前
I will go get it after the doctor, after the pharmacy,

93
00:03:33,280 --> 00:03:34,740
就去帮你拿 好吗
before the baby store, okay?

94
00:03:34,920 --> 00:03:35,640
说真的 歌洛莉亚
Honestly, Gloria,

95
00:03:35,640 --> 00:03:36,820
我真不知道你是如何办到的
I don't know how you do it.

96
00:03:36,829 --> 00:03:38,362
找到啦
Ah, found it!

97
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:40,660
-扶我一把 -小心点儿
- Help me. - Careful.

98
00:03:42,686 --> 00:03:44,491
歌洛莉亚 你没事吧
Oh, Gloria! Are you all right?

99
00:03:44,910 --> 00:03:46,440
我说了叫你扶我一把
Ay, I told you to help me!

100
00:03:46,440 --> 00:03:48,680
-真对不起 -我扭到脚了
- I am so sorry! - I twisted my ankle.

101
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:49,680
来 坐这里
Okay. Sit down right here.

102
00:03:50,220 --> 00:03:51,640
我没时间坐着了
I don't have time for this.

103
00:03:51,640 --> 00:03:53,950
不行 你不能这样走一整天啊
No, you--you can't walk around on that all day.

104
00:03:54,060 --> 00:03:55,300
不 我没事 我没事
No, I'm good. I'm good.

105
00:03:55,660 --> 00:03:57,780
没事 我会用
No. I will use...

106
00:03:58,420 --> 00:04:02,230
婴儿车当拐杖的 行不
the baby carrier as a... as a cane. Okay?

107
00:04:02,230 --> 00:04:03,407
行吧
O-okay.

108
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:07,300
保持住 就那样 好的 好的
Now hold that. Hold that. Good, good, good.

109
00:04:07,300 --> 00:04:08,980
表情忧郁点 忧郁
Now smolder. Smolder.

110
00:04:09,200 --> 00:04:10,560
完美 太好了
Perfect. Perfect.

111
00:04:11,100 --> 00:04:11,860
我猜猜看
Let me guess--

112
00:04:11,980 --> 00:04:14,180
你忘了我说的是"围脖"还是"宝宝"
You couldn't remember if I said "Boa" or "Baby,"

113
00:04:14,180 --> 00:04:15,320
所以干脆两样都带回来了
so you brought both.

114
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:17,700
歌洛莉亚受伤了
Gloria hurt herself,

115
00:04:17,700 --> 00:04:20,520
有我的责任 所以我主动提出照看乔
and it was kinda my fault, so I offered to watch Joe.

116
00:04:20,845 --> 00:04:23,960
我休息一下可以吗 我想一个人待会儿
Can I take a break? I wanna be alone.

117
00:04:23,960 --> 00:04:26,600
扮葛丽泰·嘉宝时你怎么没这股酷劲儿
Okay, where was that attitude when we were doing Greta Garbo?

118
00:04:27,360 --> 00:04:28,660
好吧 休息5分钟
Okay, fine. Take five.

119
00:04:29,880 --> 00:04:30,920
你好啊 小乔乔
Hi, baby Joe.

120
00:04:31,660 --> 00:04:33,360
你要不要来坐一会儿呢
Why don't you just sit a spell?

121
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:34,880
我们正在拍照照哦
We're just makin' pictures.

122
00:04:34,880 --> 00:04:36,600
-干嘛用密苏里州口音 -不知道
- Why are you being all Missouri? - I don't know.

123
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:38,060
大概是要回农场太兴奋了吧
I guess I'm excited to go back to the farm.

124
00:04:38,060 --> 00:04:38,740
有那么明显吗
Is it that obvious?

125
00:04:38,740 --> 00:04:40,400
你吃早饭时候说了"该屎"这个词
You said "dagburn" at breakfast.

126
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:41,440
你给我们订机票了没
Have you booked our tickets yet?

127
00:04:41,440 --> 00:04:43,355
我不确定上班时能不能走得开
You know, I-I'm not sure if I can get off work.

128
00:04:43,355 --> 00:04:44,150
好吧 但你得趁早订到票
Yeah, but you have to get the tickets

129
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:45,540
不然好座位都被抢光了
before all the good seats are taken.

130
00:04:46,080 --> 00:04:47,740
你是说那些不飞往密苏里的航班吧
You mean the ones that aren't on a plane to Missouri?

131
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:48,900
好了 亲爱的 休息时间结束
Okay, sweetie, break's over.

132
00:04:48,900 --> 00:04:50,460
还没到5分钟呢
It hasn't been five minutes.

133
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:52,420
是的 但你都吃掉5块动物饼干了
Yes, but it has been five animal crackers.

134
00:04:52,500 --> 00:04:54,960
按规定在拍摄日是一块都不能吃的 所以...
Which is five too many to eat on a shoot day. So...

135
00:04:54,960 --> 00:04:56,560
受够了 我不干了
No more! I quit!

136
00:04:57,900 --> 00:04:59,460
我的天呐 她这是鬼上身了吗
Oh, my gosh. What has gotten into her?

137
00:04:59,520 --> 00:05:00,700
我们拍了6个小时
We've been doing this for six hours,

138
00:05:00,760 --> 00:05:01,920
怎么突然之间 她就不爱玩了呢
and now all of the sudden, she doesn't love it?

139
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:03,060
我一直有种看法
You know, I have a theory.

140
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:04,360
好吧
Okay.

141
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:05,840
我想拍的照片
Well, we're only halfway through

142
00:05:05,840 --> 00:05:07,120
刚刚拍完一半
all the pictures that I wanted to do.

143
00:05:07,120 --> 00:05:09,762
灵光一现 你好啊 小乔乔
Lightbulb. Hello, baby Joe!

144
00:05:10,580 --> 00:05:12,320
你甚至可以扮作
Well, you may as well be

145
00:05:12,320 --> 00:05:15,720
暴风雨过后小镇树林里的死流浪汉
a dead hobo in the woods of a small town after a rainstorm,

146
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:18,420
因为你被我这个大星探发现咯
because you have just been discovered.

147
00:05:18,420 --> 00:05:20,820
我真是对密苏里州之行越来越没兴趣了
I'm looking less and less forward to this trip to Missouri.

148
00:05:22,580 --> 00:05:23,440
你好 帅哥
Hey, handsome.

149
00:05:23,820 --> 00:05:26,000
你能不能在这上面签个字 不用看的
Uh, can you sign this? You don't need to read it.

150
00:05:26,120 --> 00:05:27,060
从来不看
Never do!

151
00:05:28,220 --> 00:05:29,180
就在这儿
Right there.

152
00:05:29,988 --> 00:05:32,958
快问快答 大自然的高效晒后修复品是
Oh. Quick--nature's sure-fire sunburn remedy?

153
00:05:33,337 --> 00:05:34,723
"芦喂"[芦荟+喂]
Aloe?

154
00:05:35,700 --> 00:05:38,480
杰 想到我们的大赛我就超兴奋呐
Hey, Jay. Super excited about our big match.

155
00:05:38,680 --> 00:05:39,740
我昨天晚上梦到比赛了
I dreamt about it last night.

156
00:05:39,760 --> 00:05:41,060
你猜怎么着 我们赢了
Guess what? We won!

157
00:05:41,500 --> 00:05:43,680
菲尔 我太爱你了就不跟你
Phil, I like you too much to sugarcoat

158
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:46,040
拐弯抹角的了 你被队里开除了
what I'm about to say-- you're off the team.

159
00:05:46,260 --> 00:05:48,160
有意思 用幽默让我在赛前放松
Good one. Loosen me up with some pre-match humor.

160
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:48,900
我喜欢
I like it.

161
00:05:48,900 --> 00:05:52,089
不是 我找到更好的选手了 卢迪·索伦孙
Nah, I found somebody better-- Rudy Sorrenson.

162
00:05:52,100 --> 00:05:53,160
他参赛 你退出
He's in, you're out.

163
00:05:53,940 --> 00:05:54,420
好笑
Hilarious!

164
00:05:54,656 --> 00:05:56,680
坚持不懈啊
Stickin' with the bit.

165
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:58,700
我们俩变得这么亲密无间真让我高兴
I love that this is our relationship now.

166
00:05:58,800 --> 00:06:00,700
这场比赛关系重大 你的发挥又不稳定
This match is too important, and you're a wild card.

167
00:06:00,760 --> 00:06:01,300
抱歉
I'm sorry.

168
00:06:01,520 --> 00:06:01,940
杰
Jay...

169
00:06:02,660 --> 00:06:05,260
我不喜欢你现在跟我来这么一出
I'm not sure I like where this is headed.

170
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:07,820
菲尔 不是针对你 只是个保龄球赛
Phil, this is nothing personal. It's bowling.

171
00:06:08,140 --> 00:06:09,700
没关系 我明白
No, no, no. I get it.

172
00:06:10,501 --> 00:06:13,253
听着 我得挂了
Listen, um... I should get goin'.

173
00:06:13,389 --> 00:06:15,329
我的过敏症让我快要流泪了
My allergies are starting to cry.

174
00:06:20,640 --> 00:06:22,520
喂 歌洛莉亚 我就要出发了
Hey, Gloria. I was just about to leave.

175
00:06:22,580 --> 00:06:23,000
什么事
What's up?

176
00:06:23,100 --> 00:06:25,420
曼尼刚给我发了短信 他跟你说了没
Manny just texted me. Did he tell you the news?

177
00:06:25,740 --> 00:06:27,880
说了 太好了 我们晚点再庆祝
Yes. Wonderful. We'll celebrate later.

178
00:06:28,040 --> 00:06:29,560
不 他没得到独唱的机会
No. He didn't get the solo.

179
00:06:29,940 --> 00:06:31,520
他好像非常难过
I think he's very upset.

180
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:33,360
手套没拿
My glove.

181
00:06:33,660 --> 00:06:34,420
你在哪里
Where are you?

182
00:06:34,500 --> 00:06:36,520
在看医生 他在为我检查脚踝
At the doctor. He's checking my ankle.

183
00:06:37,400 --> 00:06:39,820
杰 我觉得你应该去安慰他一下
Jay, I think you should try to cheer him up.

184
00:06:39,860 --> 00:06:41,280
你何不带他去逛逛街呢
Why don't you take him shopping?

185
00:06:41,280 --> 00:06:42,840
歌洛莉亚 我5点钟比赛
Gloria, my match is at 5:00.

186
00:06:42,840 --> 00:06:43,620
我还有仪式要做
I have a ritual.

187
00:06:44,100 --> 00:06:46,320
我得走走球道 还要打两三场热身赛
I walk the lanes. I play two or three warm-up games.

188
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:49,560
他没事的 我让他跟你说
He's fine. I'll let you talk to him.

189
00:06:52,120 --> 00:06:52,840
保持黑暗 拜托
Darkness, please.

190
00:06:53,015 --> 00:06:54,840
糟糕 他在外面游泳呢
Aw, shoot. He's out in the pool.

191
00:06:54,840 --> 00:06:56,700
我怎样才能让你离开呢 唱歌吗
What do I have to do to make you go away? Sing?

192
00:06:56,796 --> 00:06:58,453
我会让他给你回电的
Uh, I'll have him call you back.

193
00:06:58,817 --> 00:07:01,489
我的生活是没有音乐的灰色地狱
My life is a music-less, gray hellscape.

194
00:07:01,500 --> 00:07:03,100
看你这样子
Wow. Well, this doesn't look

195
00:07:03,100 --> 00:07:04,620
就算带你去逛街也没用吧
like anything shopping can help you with.

196
00:07:05,100 --> 00:07:06,040
值得一试
It's worth a shot.

197
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:15,320
抱歉我刚才犹豫不决的
Sorry I was so indecisive back there.

198
00:07:15,400 --> 00:07:16,420
我今天状态不好
I'm out of it today.

199
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:17,440
你买到你想要的了
Well, you got what you want,

200
00:07:17,440 --> 00:07:18,538
今天的任务完成了
and that's what today is all about.

201
00:07:18,660 --> 00:07:20,160
别皱眉了 笑一个
Turn that frown upside-down.

202
00:07:20,520 --> 00:07:22,480
你坐15号线回家吧
Now you're gonna take this 15 local to get home.

203
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:24,360
双手抓紧那袋子
Keep both your hands tight on that bag

204
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:26,000
那趟公交途经的几个街区不太安全
because it goes through a few sketchy blocks.

205
00:07:26,180 --> 00:07:27,080
你不载我回去吗
You're not driving me?

206
00:07:27,080 --> 00:07:29,040
你把原本可以载你的时间都浪费于
Well, you kinda used up your drive time

207
00:07:29,040 --> 00:07:30,860
在一堆同样的皮带里挑选了
deciding between those identical belts.

208
00:07:31,320 --> 00:07:33,700
好吧 我只是难以接受 杰
Okay. It's just hard. You know, Jay?

209
00:07:33,920 --> 00:07:35,680
我从来都不是一个轻言放弃的人
I mean, I've never been a quitter.

210
00:07:35,860 --> 00:07:37,640
你的生活将开启新的篇章 有零钱没
Well, new chapter for you. You got any change?

211
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:40,660
一直以来 我都梦想成为一名演员
I mean, I always imagined I'd be a performer for life.

212
00:07:40,880 --> 00:07:42,620
大概有些梦想是不得不放弃的
I guess some dreams you just have to give up on.

213
00:07:42,620 --> 00:07:43,520
适时放弃才是好小伙
Know when to fold 'em.

214
00:07:43,520 --> 00:07:45,540
这是50块 会有人有零钱的
Here's a $50. Someone will have change.

215
00:07:45,960 --> 00:07:47,820
我唱歌不行 就是这样
I can't sing, period.

216
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:50,300
我真是老糊涂了
What am I thinking?

217
00:07:51,760 --> 00:07:54,260
11号线就经过家门口 车来了
The 11 goes right by the house, and there she is.

218
00:07:54,640 --> 00:07:56,180
到家了给你妈发个短信
Now text your mom when you get home.

219
00:07:58,100 --> 00:07:59,300
祝你打保龄好运
Good luck with your bowling!

220
00:07:59,940 --> 00:08:00,600
谢了 孩子
Thanks, kid!

221
00:08:07,520 --> 00:08:08,480
对 对
Yes. Yes!

222
00:08:08,960 --> 00:08:10,860
我爹的娃刚在我们这儿待了45分钟
We've had my dad's baby for 45 minutes,

223
00:08:10,860 --> 00:08:11,780
就已经被穿上裙子了
and he's already in a dress.

224
00:08:11,940 --> 00:08:14,320
好了 莉莉 我们的重头戏可以上了
Okay, Lily, I think we're ready for our most important setup--

225
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:16,360
-秀兰·邓波儿小姐 -给你
- Miss Shirley Temple. - Here.

226
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:19,200
你真是个好助理 胜过当模特哦
Oh, wow. You're an even better assistant than you are a model.

227
00:08:19,300 --> 00:08:20,100
我不在乎
I don't care.

228
00:08:20,100 --> 00:08:22,480
好吧 她还是当模特时那股冷漠劲儿
Okay, well, that came through in her modeling.

229
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:23,020
她可是我们的女儿
Our daughter.

230
00:08:23,020 --> 00:08:25,448
我知道 我只是有些伤心 米奇尔
Okay, I know, but it just hurts, Mitchell.

231
00:08:25,460 --> 00:08:28,160
那是她长大后抛弃的第一个我们的喜好
It's the first one of our things that she's outgrown.

232
00:08:28,160 --> 00:08:30,240
但我们把她培养得有自己的
Well, you know, but isn't it great that we've raised her

233
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:32,140
想法和爱好 难道不好吗
to have opinions and interests of her own?

234
00:08:32,140 --> 00:08:34,700
但要这么早吗 她还"恁"小呢
But this early? She's still so daggum young.

235
00:08:34,700 --> 00:08:36,040
这又是什么南方方言
Okay, is that another southern thing,

236
00:08:36,040 --> 00:08:37,760
还是你在回忆她的越南名字
or are you just trying to remember her Vietnamese name?

237
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:39,880
我的神啊 这玩意儿卡住了
Oh, my gosh. This thing is stuck.

238
00:08:39,880 --> 00:08:41,540
什么 怎么会呢
What? How--how could it be?

239
00:08:41,540 --> 00:08:42,980
-卡住了 -天啊
- It is stuck. - Oh!

240
00:08:42,980 --> 00:08:44,080
我用胶水粘的
I glued it.

241
00:08:44,567 --> 00:08:46,990
你 你为什么要那么做
W-w-why--why would you do that?

242
00:08:46,990 --> 00:08:49,760
因为这珍·克罗弗德假发总是往下掉
Because the Jane Crawford wig kept falling off him.

243
00:08:49,760 --> 00:08:50,360
是琼·克罗弗德
It's Joan Crawford.

244
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:51,645
你真分得清轻重缓急
'cause that's what's important here.

245
00:08:51,645 --> 00:08:54,774
-好吧 -粘到他自己的头发上了
- Okay. - It's--it's glued to his actual hair.

246
00:08:55,060 --> 00:08:55,800
好吧 莉莉
Okay, Lily,

247
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:59,260
这种行为很恶劣 非常恶劣
This is bad. This is very, very bad.

248
00:08:59,420 --> 00:09:00,880
对不起 我只是想帮忙
Sorry. I was trying to help.

249
00:09:01,062 --> 00:09:03,100
好吧 我应该料到的
Okay. Well, I should've seen this coming.

250
00:09:03,100 --> 00:09:04,520
我用一个更年轻的模特取代了她
I replaced her with somebody younger,

251
00:09:04,520 --> 00:09:06,760
她纯粹是因为嫉妒 搞砸了乔的拍摄
and she sabotaged Joe's shoot out of sheer jealousy.

252
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:09,160
也许她真有当模特的天分
Maybe she does have what it takes to be a model.

253
00:09:10,780 --> 00:09:11,820
你能...
Can you...

254
00:09:16,940 --> 00:09:18,280
-唱歌 -什么
- Sing! - What?

255
00:09:18,560 --> 00:09:19,780
我听过你洗澡的时候唱歌
I've heard you sing in the shower.

256
00:09:20,040 --> 00:09:21,760
你坐我车的时候也唱过 你从没跑调过
You sing in the car with me. You never miss a note!

257
00:09:22,020 --> 00:09:24,060
你的症结在于不能在别人面前唱 唱啊
Your problem is doing it around people. Sing!

258
00:09:24,180 --> 00:09:25,760
-你要我现在唱 -对
- You want me to sing now? - Yeah!

259
00:09:25,760 --> 00:09:26,760
那都是你思想在掌控
It's all in your head!

260
00:09:27,080 --> 00:09:28,520
只要你克服怯场
When you get over that little stage fright,

261
00:09:28,520 --> 00:09:30,440
就再也不会在试音时卡壳了 唱啊
you'll never choke an audition again. Sing!

262
00:09:31,263 --> 00:09:33,580
*傀儡 乞丐*
*I've been a puppet, a pauper*

263
00:09:33,580 --> 00:09:34,760
-*海盗 诗人* -那不叫唱歌
- *a pirate, a poet* - That's not singing!

264
00:09:35,040 --> 00:09:37,200
-放开唱 -*人质 国王*
- Attack it! - *a pawn and a king*

265
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:40,480
*起起伏伏 跌跌宕宕*
*I've been up and down and over and out*

266
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:42,340
*我总铭记一事*
*And I know one thing*

267
00:09:42,340 --> 00:09:43,060
什么事
What's that thing?!

268
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:45,720
*每次摔得*
*Each time I find myself*

269
00:09:45,720 --> 00:09:48,800
-*灰头土脸* -对 你做到了
- *flat on my face* - Yeah! Now you got it!

270
00:09:48,800 --> 00:09:50,760
*我都会重新爬起*
*I pick myself up*

271
00:09:50,760 --> 00:09:52,871
伸进购物袋取出帽子吧 我知道你想那么做
Get in that bag! I know you want to!

272
00:09:52,871 --> 00:09:54,226
*回归到行列*
*and get back in the race*

273
00:09:54,226 --> 00:09:55,397
-对 -*所谓生活*
- Yeah! - *That's life*

274
00:09:55,397 --> 00:09:56,859
-*所谓生活* -唱给我听 宝贝
- *That's life* - Sing it to me, baby!

275
00:09:57,140 --> 00:09:59,700
*正如人们平常所说*
*That's what all the people say*

276
00:09:59,700 --> 00:10:01,560
我的天啊 那是珍妮·吉布斯吗
Oh, my god. Is that Janie Gibbs?

277
00:10:02,760 --> 00:10:04,400
天啊 她的皮肤看上去像
Yikes. Her skin looks like

278
00:10:04,400 --> 00:10:06,851
被重新弄平准备再利用的皱巴巴的锡纸
crumpled tinfoil you try to smooth out and use again.

279
00:10:06,860 --> 00:10:08,640
提醒我千万不能在你面前显现老态
Remind me not to get old in front of you.

280
00:10:10,640 --> 00:10:13,580
我甚至见不着孩子们的面了
I don't even see the kids' faces anymore.

281
00:10:13,800 --> 00:10:16,780
我靠他们笔记本上的贴画来认人
I know them by the decals on their laptops.

282
00:10:16,780 --> 00:10:18,700
库克教授
Professor Cooke.

283
00:10:19,660 --> 00:10:21,140
依旧是校园里最性感的男人
Still the sexiest man on campus.

284
00:10:21,140 --> 00:10:23,180
-想知道个小秘密吗 -你跟他约会过
- Wanna know a little somethin'? - You dated him.

285
00:10:23,180 --> 00:10:24,500
你怎么知道的
How did you know that?

286
00:10:24,580 --> 00:10:26,020
我们一直小心保守秘密
We were so careful with that secret.

287
00:10:26,160 --> 00:10:28,620
你有天穿了件大号的粗呢夹克去吃早餐
You wore an oversized tweed jacket to breakfast

288
00:10:28,620 --> 00:10:30,300
还管我的兔子叫可转变的资本家
and called my rabbit convertible "Bourgeois."

289
00:10:30,300 --> 00:10:31,860
确实是啊
Well, it kinda was.

290
00:10:31,860 --> 00:10:33,260
我们都好嫉妒你
We were so jealous of you.

291
00:10:33,380 --> 00:10:35,000
他好性感
He was so hot.

292
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:37,360
穿着海豚短裤在校园里慢跑
Jogging around campus in those dolphin shorts.

293
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:39,460
那不是我和他在一起的原因
And that wasn't even why I was with him.

294
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:40,620
我是看上了他的聪明才智
It was his mind.

295
00:10:41,120 --> 00:10:42,160
你知道有些人
Do you know those people

296
00:10:42,160 --> 00:10:43,260
光是在他们周围就会让人觉得
who make you feel smart

297
00:10:43,260 --> 00:10:44,520
自己也变聪慧了
just by being near them?

298
00:10:45,760 --> 00:10:47,300
有次我看到你们做了
I watched you guys once.

299
00:10:48,340 --> 00:10:48,580
克莱尔
Claire!

300
00:10:49,260 --> 00:10:50,180
克莱尔的朋友
Claire's friend!

301
00:10:50,420 --> 00:10:51,960
他居然记得我
He remembers me.

302
00:10:53,180 --> 00:10:54,220
你好 教授
Hello, professor.

303
00:10:56,740 --> 00:10:58,320
见到你真好
It's so good to see you.

304
00:10:58,480 --> 00:11:01,120
显然 学术生活很适合你
Clearly, the academic life agrees with you.

305
00:11:01,120 --> 00:11:03,559
看来我们都混得不错
Oh, I guess we're all doing pretty well.

306
00:11:03,980 --> 00:11:04,700
-干杯 -干杯
- Cheers. - Cheers.

307
00:11:04,700 --> 00:11:06,555
我也在默默看着你呢
Here's lookin' at you, too.

308
00:11:06,555 --> 00:11:08,802
你那时也老这样吗
Were you always like this?

309
00:11:09,060 --> 00:11:09,240
克莱尔
Claire?

310
00:11:09,460 --> 00:11:10,620
我的天呐 怎么可能
Oh, my God. No way.

311
00:11:10,620 --> 00:11:12,719
土杜 我的上帝
Tater! Oh, my gosh! Aah!

312
00:11:13,580 --> 00:11:15,560
听说你混得相当不错
I heard you're hugely successful.

313
00:11:15,900 --> 00:11:18,720
还行吧 你们美女都喊我"土豆"了
Yeah, well, you know, when all the hot girls call you "Tater,"

314
00:11:18,860 --> 00:11:20,120
我怎么也得努把力
You tend to try a little harder.

315
00:11:20,400 --> 00:11:21,680
真可爱 你真可爱
Adorable. Adorable!

316
00:11:21,706 --> 00:11:23,800
-你太可爱了 -克莱尔
- You're adorable! - Claire!

317
00:11:23,800 --> 00:11:25,240
亲爱的 好啊
Honey! Hey!

318
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:26,932
菲尔 你来干什么
Hi, Phil! What are you doing here?

319
00:11:28,140 --> 00:11:31,000
你爸不让我参加他的保龄球赛了
Uh... Your dad dumped me from his bowling team,

320
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:32,280
所以我就来给你个惊喜
So I thought I'd surprise you.

321
00:11:33,520 --> 00:11:35,100
好吧 过来一下
Okay. Wait. Come here a second.

322
00:11:36,180 --> 00:11:38,180
我 我以为你看见我会很开心呢
I-I thought you'd be happy to see me.

323
00:11:38,180 --> 00:11:39,620
我开心啊 真的
I am! No, I am!

324
00:11:39,720 --> 00:11:40,520
我很开心
I am happy.

325
00:11:40,820 --> 00:11:41,500
出什么事了吗
Is something wrong?

326
00:11:43,660 --> 00:11:45,060
就是 就是会有点尴尬
It's just-- it's a little bit embarrassing.

327
00:11:45,160 --> 00:11:47,260
我的前男友也在这儿 所以...
The guy that I dated right before you is here, so...

328
00:11:47,260 --> 00:11:49,070
那也没什么好尴尬的啊
Oh. Well, that's nothing to be embarrassed about.

329
00:11:49,070 --> 00:11:50,180
谁没有旧爱啊
We all have exes.

330
00:11:50,180 --> 00:11:52,120
你在遇到我之前甩掉的男人在这儿
So the guy you dumped right before you met me is here.

331
00:11:52,120 --> 00:11:52,720
没什么大不了啊
No big deal.

332
00:11:54,280 --> 00:11:54,680
其实嘛...
Well...

333
00:11:54,976 --> 00:11:56,380
是他甩的我
He might've dumped me.

334
00:11:56,380 --> 00:11:57,960
你不是说从来都是你甩别人吗
I thought you said you'd never been dumped.

335
00:11:59,760 --> 00:12:01,160
其实嘛...就有一次
Well...Maybe one time.

336
00:12:01,160 --> 00:12:04,000
那...他甩了你
So...He dumped you,

337
00:12:04,640 --> 00:12:07,140
你情伤痊愈后就遇到了我
You healed completely, and then you met me.

338
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:11,040
其实嘛...
Well...

339
00:12:11,040 --> 00:12:13,760
我扔过一些比克莱尔差劲很多的东西都深感后悔
I've regretted throwing away things way more beaten up than Claire.

340
00:12:14,820 --> 00:12:17,700
如果那个校园花花公子想和她重修旧好
So if this campus Casanova had thoughts of reclaiming her,

341
00:12:17,700 --> 00:12:19,240
猜猜怎么着 万人迷
Guess what, hot shot?

342
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:21,120
法律上来说 她仍然是我的
Legally, I still own her.

343
00:12:22,260 --> 00:12:24,620
伙计 我总是在想谁这么有福气
Man, I always wondered who'd be lucky enough

344
00:12:24,620 --> 00:12:26,180
会把大美人克莱尔·普里契特娶回家
to marry the beautiful Claire Pritchett.

345
00:12:26,860 --> 00:12:28,560
跟运气不沾边 小伙
No luck involved, hombre.

346
00:12:28,560 --> 00:12:30,000
她遇见我 爱上我
She saw, she liked,

347
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:31,380
怀了我的娃 非我不嫁
she got pregnant, she had to.

348
00:12:31,700 --> 00:12:33,380
好啦 别霸占着他了
Hey! Stop hogging this guy.

349
00:12:33,420 --> 00:12:35,000
我们都20年没见面了
I haven't seen him in 20 years.

350
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:35,714
我的土杜
My Tater.

351
00:12:35,714 --> 00:12:37,100
我得走了
Look, I've gotta run,

352
00:12:37,100 --> 00:12:39,080
但我很想请你们去我家玩玩
But I'd love to have you guys by my apartment

353
00:12:39,080 --> 00:12:40,380
喝杯餐前鸡尾酒
for a cocktail before dinner.

354
00:12:40,434 --> 00:12:42,520
我们当然会去
Oh! We are totally doing that.

355
00:12:42,520 --> 00:12:44,300
我们可能得回宾馆...
Oh. We might have to go back to the hotel--

356
00:12:44,300 --> 00:12:46,274
不不不 这周末我们就是来玩的嘛
No, no, no. Ah, that's what this weekend's for.

357
00:12:46,274 --> 00:12:48,420
尽情欢笑 认识新朋友
Having a laugh, meetin' new people.

358
00:12:48,420 --> 00:12:50,400
我可一点都不想错过
I don't want to miss any of it.

359
00:12:51,940 --> 00:12:53,120
我可不会错过什么[警惕]
And I don't miss much.

360
00:12:57,760 --> 00:12:59,940
快关门 蒸汽都跑出去了
Close the door! You're letting the steam out!

361
00:12:59,940 --> 00:13:01,220
那假发摘下来了吗
Is the wig coming loose?

362
00:13:01,220 --> 00:13:03,320
是啊 米奇尔 早就摘下来了
Oh, yes, Mitchell. It's completely off his head.

363
00:13:03,480 --> 00:13:04,260
我们在里面待这么半天
We're just staying in here

364
00:13:04,260 --> 00:13:06,420
只因为我们大丈夫和小宝贝
because there's nothing babies and big guys love more

365
00:13:06,420 --> 00:13:07,660
纯粹喜欢蒸桑拿
than 100% humidity.

366
00:13:07,860 --> 00:13:08,120
我的上帝
Oh, my God.

367
00:13:08,120 --> 00:13:10,200
歌洛莉亚看见了会怎么修理我啊
Do you realize what Gloria's gonna do when she sees this?

368
00:13:10,640 --> 00:13:12,900
上次我给曼尼画了个印度彩绘 她都揍了我一顿
She punched me when I got Manny that henna tattoo.

369
00:13:12,900 --> 00:13:14,880
不是我平常那种轻轻打
And not the side-of-the-hand way that I do it.

370
00:13:15,600 --> 00:13:17,460
是戴着结实的大钻戒用硬拳揍的
This had rings and knuckles.

371
00:13:17,820 --> 00:13:19,680
别担心 我想了个B计划
Don't worry. I'm working on a plan "B."

372
00:13:20,580 --> 00:13:22,240
或者应该说...
Or should I say...

373
00:13:22,240 --> 00:13:24,363
-比伯计划 -不行
- Plan Bieber? - No.

374
00:13:24,540 --> 00:13:25,700
别啊 我只是给他设计了个发型
No, I just gave him a little bit of a haircut.

375
00:13:25,700 --> 00:13:27,441
-把孩子给我 我懂的 -好吧
- Give me the baby. I know. - Yes!

376
00:13:30,140 --> 00:13:32,200
那是我行程中最好的部分
I mean, that's the great part of my schedule.

377
00:13:32,240 --> 00:13:34,280
几乎每个夏天都能去趟欧洲
We make it to Europe almost every summer.

378
00:13:34,560 --> 00:13:36,160
你们肯定也经常旅行吧
But I'm sure you guys travel.

379
00:13:36,380 --> 00:13:38,280
说实话 我这15年去的地方
Well, honestly, I don't think I've been anywhere

380
00:13:38,280 --> 00:13:40,495
基本就是儿童游乐场
without a water slide in 15 years.

381
00:13:41,662 --> 00:13:42,490
真有意思
That's funny.

382
00:13:42,500 --> 00:13:44,780
她提过埃斯特 道格
She's mentioned Esther, Dougie,

383
00:13:45,460 --> 00:13:47,020
特里普 艾弗罗·乔迪
Tripp, Afro Judy...

384
00:13:47,480 --> 00:13:48,220
但土杜这名字
The name "Tater"

385
00:13:48,220 --> 00:13:51,600
她过去20年确实从没提过一次
has literally never even come up once in the last 20 years.

386
00:13:51,614 --> 00:13:53,540
我一点都不奇怪
Oh, I don't know why I'm surprised.

387
00:13:53,540 --> 00:13:55,200
我疯狂地爱了她四年
I was madly in love with her for four years...

388
00:13:55,280 --> 00:13:56,760
可她从来对我视而不见
And I was basically invisible

389
00:13:56,760 --> 00:13:58,540
直到某天我被炸土豆噎到她才注意到我
until the day I choked on that tater tot.

390
00:13:58,540 --> 00:14:01,020
等等 我还以为你是她的旧爱呢
Wait. Uh, I-I thought you were her ex.

391
00:14:01,020 --> 00:14:01,720
我倒是想
I wish.

392
00:14:04,391 --> 00:14:07,220
菲尔 这周末你都在吗
Oh! So, Phil, are you here all weekend?

393
00:14:07,220 --> 00:14:07,660
才不
No.

394
00:14:07,660 --> 00:14:11,023
真遗憾 我还想推荐几项活动呢
Well, that's too bad. I was gonna suggest some activities.

395
00:14:11,023 --> 00:14:12,100
朝圣者中心要举办
The Palmer Center is doing

396
00:14:12,100 --> 00:14:14,420
印象派画家的回顾展
a wonderful retrospective of impressionists.

397
00:14:14,700 --> 00:14:16,000
确实很遗憾
Oh. That is a shame.

398
00:14:16,220 --> 00:14:17,940
那个领域我倒是挺有研究
That's a field I know quite a bit about.

399
00:14:18,082 --> 00:14:19,516
菲尔 别丢人了
Phil. No.

400
00:14:19,516 --> 00:14:21,397
从我身上能看出
Uh, you can see the influence, can't you,

401
00:14:21,397 --> 00:14:24,366
早期模仿秀演员的神韵吧
of the, uh, early impressionists?

402
00:14:24,468 --> 00:14:25,749
比如...
The, uh...

403
00:14:25,952 --> 00:14:27,091
里奇·利特
Rich Little,

404
00:14:27,101 --> 00:14:28,443
弗兰克·高辛
the Frank Gorshin,

405
00:14:28,443 --> 00:14:31,260
再比如吉米·费伦节目上的
on the... Jimmy Fallon, if you will.

406
00:14:31,260 --> 00:14:32,420
人家说的是画家
He meant the painter kind.

407
00:14:32,660 --> 00:14:33,040
好吧
Yes.

408
00:14:33,040 --> 00:14:35,460
-再来点喝的吗 -不了 没完呢
- Freshen your drink? - No. No, not done.

409
00:14:35,460 --> 00:14:36,960
你是不是盼着我俩玩完呢
You'd know if I was finished with something,

410
00:14:36,960 --> 00:14:37,500
才不会玩完呢
And I'm not.

411
00:14:37,952 --> 00:14:40,425
-那就只有一杯咯 -是啊
- Just the one then. - Yeah.

412
00:14:42,100 --> 00:14:42,780
你干什么呢
What are you doing?

413
00:14:42,960 --> 00:14:44,920
对不住 我在你前任面前让你难堪了吗
Sorry. Did I embarrass you in front of your ex-boyfriend?

414
00:14:45,020 --> 00:14:46,100
我就知道
Yeah, I know about that.

415
00:14:46,200 --> 00:14:48,700
我都告诉你了 你不会真吃醋吧
Because I told you. Come on. You can't seriously be jealous.

416
00:14:50,320 --> 00:14:52,180
菲尔 都是20年前的事了
Phil, it was 20 years ago.

417
00:14:52,180 --> 00:14:54,140
控制一下
Reign it in.

418
00:14:54,140 --> 00:14:56,300
拜托啦 你让我觉得有点难堪了
Come on. You're embarrassing me a little.

419
00:14:56,440 --> 00:14:58,140
行 但你能否认你之所以
Fine, but do you deny that part of the reason

420
00:14:58,140 --> 00:15:00,540
想一个人来 部分原因就是为了那家伙吗
you wanted to come back here by yourself is that guy?

421
00:15:01,080 --> 00:15:02,800
我觉得那不一定是坏事 克莱尔
I'm not even sure it's a bad thing, Claire.

422
00:15:02,800 --> 00:15:04,700
人都会好奇自己没选的那条路通往何方
We all wonder about the paths we didn't follow,

423
00:15:04,700 --> 00:15:05,700
你尽可放心大胆承认
But you could admit it.

424
00:15:08,040 --> 00:15:10,180
我要是承认了 你可不准生气
Well, you can't be mad at me if I do admit it.

425
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:11,440
不会的
I won't.

426
00:15:13,220 --> 00:15:15,040
我不是在承认
Well, I'm not... admitting it,

427
00:15:15,100 --> 00:15:18,240
没有你的话我不会这么幸福
Because I couldn't be happier than I am in my life with you.

428
00:15:18,240 --> 00:15:19,748
可是
But, mm...

429
00:15:20,340 --> 00:15:21,860
我是说 或许
I mean... Maybe...

430
00:15:21,860 --> 00:15:26,160
我略微想过 偷偷地瞄一眼
a tiny part of me just wanted to sort of peek through the window

431
00:15:26,160 --> 00:15:29,070
那曾经可能会属于我的生活
and... see the life that might've been.

432
00:15:30,960 --> 00:15:33,020
连个电梯都没有 爬楼累死老娘了
Never get tired of those three flights.

433
00:15:33,240 --> 00:15:33,540
麦琪
Maggie!

434
00:15:34,720 --> 00:15:35,820
跟大家打个招呼吧
Say hi to everyone.

435
00:15:36,678 --> 00:15:38,496
等会儿 天使宝贝
In a second, angel.

436
00:15:38,660 --> 00:15:39,300
老娘这一天过得不太顺
Mama's had a day.

437
00:15:41,140 --> 00:15:43,020
我还以为那是卧室呢
Oh, I thought that was the bedroom.

438
00:15:43,080 --> 00:15:44,560
这屋就是卧室 亲爱的
You're in the bedroom, honey...

439
00:15:44,560 --> 00:15:46,860
也是客厅 书房
And the living room and the study

440
00:15:46,860 --> 00:15:48,340
和健身房
and the gym.

441
00:15:48,612 --> 00:15:49,420
可不管怎么说
Mm. But anyway...

442
00:15:49,420 --> 00:15:51,000
听我说 不好意思失礼了
Listen to me. I'm being rude.

443
00:15:51,160 --> 00:15:53,480
大家都好吧 家里怎么样啊
How is everybody? How's things?

444
00:15:53,490 --> 00:15:54,260
-还不错 -其实
- Not too bad. - Actually...

445
00:15:54,260 --> 00:15:57,320
不 我就是问 家里什么都有感觉如何
No, I'm literally asking you, how is it to have things?

446
00:16:00,020 --> 00:16:01,700
噪音每天准点啊
Yep, right on schedule.

447
00:16:01,700 --> 00:16:03,860
小声点 吵死了
Keep it down, ya hood rats!

448
00:16:03,860 --> 00:16:05,540
麦琪 你当年也是个学生
Maggie, you were once a student.

449
00:16:05,700 --> 00:16:06,440
我记得呢
I remember.

450
00:16:07,260 --> 00:16:09,360
就是那时候上的这条一穷二白的贼船
That's when I boarded this little rocket ship to the moon.

451
00:16:15,248 --> 00:16:16,920
菲尔 等会 谢谢你
Phil, wait. Thank you.

452
00:16:16,920 --> 00:16:18,820
-谢什么 -感谢一切
- For what? - Everything.

453
00:16:19,700 --> 00:16:21,580
真搞不懂那家伙怎么当上教授的
I'm not sure how that guy got to be a professor.

454
00:16:21,580 --> 00:16:23,644
他蠢到什么份上才能甩了你啊
He'd have to be pretty stupid to dump you.

455
00:16:25,120 --> 00:16:26,400
派对要开始了
Hey, the party's starting,

456
00:16:26,520 --> 00:16:28,500
有个赏心悦目的大帅哥
and there's a really good-looking guy

457
00:16:28,500 --> 00:16:29,920
我盼着跟他跳舞呢
I was hoping to do a little dancing with, so...

458
00:16:30,060 --> 00:16:31,060
-你指我吗 -当然
- You mean me? - Yes.

459
00:16:31,240 --> 00:16:32,160
等等 走之前
Wait. Before we go,

460
00:16:32,160 --> 00:16:33,820
我想知道那里还有没有前男友
are there any more exes I should know about?

461
00:16:33,920 --> 00:16:35,480
亲爱的 你把我想成什么了
Honey, what do you think I was like?

462
00:16:35,600 --> 00:16:36,900
克莱尔·普里契特
Hey, Claire Pritchett!

463
00:16:37,340 --> 00:16:38,940
斯特勒院长
Hey, Dean Stoller!

464
00:16:40,120 --> 00:16:41,260
那只是段小情史
Super quick story.

465
00:16:43,560 --> 00:16:45,860
还好 有时间实施C计划
All right, it's not too late for plan "C"--

466
00:16:46,180 --> 00:16:47,600
放下宝宝我们就溜
We drop the baby and run.

467
00:16:47,800 --> 00:16:50,520
什么 不行 你得跟她坦白
What? No. You have to tell her what you did.

468
00:16:50,600 --> 00:16:51,720
你剃了人家孩子的头发
You scalped her baby.

469
00:16:51,780 --> 00:16:53,540
我得把假发剪下来
I had to cut that wig off.

470
00:16:53,660 --> 00:16:55,020
那你说怎么办
What did you expect me to do?

471
00:16:55,340 --> 00:16:56,520
他不肯戴帽子
He keeps pulling his hat off.

472
00:16:56,520 --> 00:16:57,720
你可以放着我来啊
Okay, well, you could've let me do it.

473
00:16:57,720 --> 00:16:59,600
我接受过维达·沙宣的32小时美发训练
I have 32 hours of Vidal Sassoon training.

474
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:02,540
因为创意分歧我罢课了 住嘴吧
What? I left the program over creative differences. Shut up.

475
00:17:04,320 --> 00:17:04,760
你们好
Hola!

476
00:17:05,100 --> 00:17:06,440
-你好 -你好
- Hola! - Hola!

477
00:17:07,680 --> 00:17:10,080
我得宝贝小天使
Oh! There's my little angel.

478
00:17:10,860 --> 00:17:12,300
他怎么样啊
How was he?

479
00:17:12,351 --> 00:17:15,040
说 说起来好笑
Uh... There--there's a funny story here.

480
00:17:15,040 --> 00:17:15,160
歌洛莉亚
Gloria!

481
00:17:15,170 --> 00:17:16,873
别管那宝贝
Forgot about that baby...

482
00:17:17,400 --> 00:17:19,060
看看这个宝贝
And check out this one!

483
00:17:19,780 --> 00:17:23,240
你打败了衣柜衣柜衣柜衣柜衣柜队吗
You beat closets, closets, closets, closets, closets?!

484
00:17:23,240 --> 00:17:24,700
我们把他们打趴下了
We destroyed them!

485
00:17:24,740 --> 00:17:26,560
是衣柜衣柜衣柜衣柜队
And it's closets, closets, closets, closets.

486
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:27,340
我说的是什么
What did I say?

487
00:17:27,340 --> 00:17:28,600
我昨天教了你半个小时
We went through this for a half-hour yesterday.

488
00:17:28,600 --> 00:17:29,360
别折磨我了
I can't do it again.

489
00:17:29,360 --> 00:17:31,706
不 你去告诉她
Nope. You're gonna have to tell her.

490
00:17:31,720 --> 00:17:32,520
什么 凭什么呀
What? Why?

491
00:17:32,720 --> 00:17:34,280
她手上那两枚戒指跟凶器似的
Because she has two new rings.

492
00:17:34,280 --> 00:17:36,060
一拳能刮掉我一块肉
That--that's gonna take the meat right off the bone.

493
00:17:36,060 --> 00:17:37,540
小卡 只要你替我背黑锅
Okay, Cam, you take the fall for me,

494
00:17:37,780 --> 00:17:39,320
我就陪你去密苏里州
And I will go with you to Missouri.

495
00:17:39,320 --> 00:17:40,880
待一礼拜都行
I'll even go for a whole week.

496
00:17:41,380 --> 00:17:42,620
十天
Make it ten days.

497
00:17:42,920 --> 00:17:43,160
好吧
Okay, fine.

498
00:17:43,180 --> 00:17:44,660
但我不希望周一见到的动物
But I don't want to meet anything on Monday

499
00:17:44,660 --> 00:17:45,897
周五时成为我的盘中餐
that I'm gonna eat on Friday.

500
00:17:45,897 --> 00:17:47,307
那是必然的
Oh, well, that's gonna happen.

501
00:17:47,307 --> 00:17:50,240
我完美的小天使
Oh! My perfect angel!

502
00:17:50,240 --> 00:17:51,700
交给你了 你最棒了
You got this. You're good.

503
00:17:52,880 --> 00:17:53,980
歌洛莉亚 你还记不记得
You know, Gloria, do you remember

504
00:17:53,980 --> 00:17:55,780
几个月前我把火锅借给你
that chafing dish I lent you a couple months back

505
00:17:55,780 --> 00:17:57,000
你还给我时却有个缺口
that you returned with a chip in it?

506
00:17:57,280 --> 00:17:59,180
每次卢克来
Every time that Luke comes over,

507
00:17:59,320 --> 00:18:01,980
都会把阁楼里的东西翻出来
he takes things out of the attic and leaves them just...

508
00:18:01,980 --> 00:18:02,780
到处乱放
everywhere!

509
00:18:03,420 --> 00:18:04,040
是啊
Yeah.

510
00:18:04,040 --> 00:18:06,740
你知道吗 有趣的是 那个火锅
Well, you know, funny thing about that chafing dish

511
00:18:06,740 --> 00:18:09,360
是我祖母的 她是从...
is it was my grandmother's, and it was given to her--

512
00:18:09,860 --> 00:18:10,220
卢克
Luke!

513
00:18:14,960 --> 00:18:17,300
曼尼 看到你真是太好了
Oh, hey, Manny. Glad I ran into you.

514
00:18:17,300 --> 00:18:19,636
听着 独唱的角色归你了
Listen, I'm gonna give you the solo.

515
00:18:19,636 --> 00:18:22,210
真的吗 你肯定是听说了我今天的事
Really? You must've heard what happened to me today.

516
00:18:22,220 --> 00:18:23,800
我现在很自信 我知道我可以
I feel confident now and I know I can do--

517
00:18:23,800 --> 00:18:25,000
我才不在乎呢
Yeah, I don't care about ,any of that stuff.

518
00:18:25,000 --> 00:18:26,300
我只需要你跟你妈说
I just need you to tell you mom

519
00:18:26,300 --> 00:18:28,120
你给你弟弟乔剪了头发 好吗
that you gave your brother joe a haircut, okay?

520
00:18:28,220 --> 00:18:29,820
没问题 能有多难看
No problem. How bad could it be?

521
00:18:34,160 --> 00:18:36,300
总之 我听说你有一封信需要家长签名
Anyway, I heard you need a letter from school signed.

522
00:18:36,312 --> 00:18:39,580
我的《独立宣言》仿制品做得可真了
I kinda nailed my declaration of independence replica.

523
00:18:39,580 --> 00:18:41,020
用这支笔伪造了所有的签名
Forged every signature with this pen.

524
00:18:41,020 --> 00:18:42,540
-那么 -不用多说了
- So... - Stop.

525
00:18:42,540 --> 00:18:43,120
我们成交
We have a deal.

526
00:18:43,780 --> 00:18:45,280
我说宝宝的头发是我剪的
I'll say I cut the baby's hair.

527
00:18:45,520 --> 00:18:46,620
你这支神笔就归我
And you give me that cool pen.

528
00:18:46,740 --> 00:18:49,120
-什么 我不是这意思 -就这么定了
- What? No. No, that's not what I was going to... - A deal's a deal.

529
00:18:50,900 --> 00:18:51,940
莉莉 有小偷
A thief, Lily.

530
00:18:51,940 --> 00:18:54,361
偷吃了我妈特地
That's who ate my last piece of cake

531
00:18:54,361 --> 00:18:57,539
从哥伦比亚寄来的蛋糕的最后一块
that my mother send me specially from Colombia.

532
00:18:57,760 --> 00:18:59,220
那蛋糕可以催母乳
It helps you make the milk.

533
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:04,260
这个奖杯真不错
Such a cool trophy.

534
00:19:04,654 --> 00:19:07,088
那个新来的卢迪·索伦孙表现怎么样
Say, how'd that new guy Rudy Sorrenson do?

535
00:19:07,088 --> 00:19:08,080
非常棒
He was great.

536
00:19:08,080 --> 00:19:09,620
真有意思 他居然和以前的
It's funny how he has the same name

537
00:19:09,620 --> 00:19:12,100
职业选手卢道夫·索伦孙同名
as one-time pro bowler Rudolph Sorrenson,

538
00:19:12,100 --> 00:19:14,480
真是这样的话 可是违反联赛规则的
which would be against league rules.

539
00:19:14,880 --> 00:19:16,667
我觉得挺有意思的
Well, I'd find it funny.

540
00:19:18,820 --> 00:19:21,600
杰 快点 你得带孩子们去看电影
Jay, hurry up. You have to take the kids to the movie.

541
00:19:22,620 --> 00:19:24,940
为什么宝宝还戴着帽子
And why does the baby still have that hat on?

542
00:19:24,960 --> 00:19:26,040
他会热死的
He's going to burn up.

543
00:19:26,080 --> 00:19:27,940
歌洛莉亚 有件事我要坦白
Gloria, I have a confession to make.

544
00:19:28,520 --> 00:19:29,780
我给乔剪了头发
I gave Joe a haircut.

545
00:19:30,840 --> 00:19:31,660
很难看
It's bad.

546
00:19:31,820 --> 00:19:32,840
你为什么这样做
Why would you do that?

547
00:19:32,840 --> 00:19:35,060
我小时候 我爸经常给我剪头发
My dad used to cut my hair when I was a kid,

548
00:19:35,060 --> 00:19:37,380
我觉得这样可以增进我和宝宝间的感情
And I thought it'd be a nice way for the baby and me to bond.

549
00:19:37,400 --> 00:19:40,340
但是我搞砸了
But I just made a mess of things...

550
00:19:41,100 --> 00:19:43,040
我把一切都搞砸了
Like I... make a mess of everything.

551
00:19:43,540 --> 00:19:46,220
我看看
Let me take a look at this.

552
00:19:46,902 --> 00:19:47,720
-我的天 -太难看了
- Ay, dios mio! - Wow. It's really bad.

553
00:19:47,720 --> 00:19:50,780
爸 你为什么要对亲生儿子下这种毒手
Dad, why would you do that to your own son?

554
00:19:50,800 --> 00:19:51,700
他才这么小
He's just a baby.

555
00:19:51,700 --> 00:19:53,309
而且你还偷吃蛋糕
Plus you ate that cake.

556
00:19:53,320 --> 00:19:55,400
够了 别再怪他了
Okay, enough. Leave him alone.

557
00:19:55,600 --> 00:19:57,960
他本来可以编些疯狂的谎话
He could have invented some crazy story,

558
00:19:58,060 --> 00:20:00,220
但他却说了实话
but instead he decided to tell the truth.

559
00:20:00,740 --> 00:20:01,980
家人就应该这样
That's what families do.

560
00:20:01,980 --> 00:20:03,140
-是的 -对
- Yes, it is. - Right.

561
00:20:03,140 --> 00:20:04,540
好了 快走吧
Okay, go. Go, go, go.

562
00:20:05,640 --> 00:20:07,460
莉莉 宝贝 我们走了 快来
Lily, sweetie, we're leaving! Come on!

563
00:20:07,720 --> 00:20:11,060
我知道他们都以为我会大发哥伦比亚式脾气
I know that they expected me to go all Colombian crazy.

564
00:20:11,060 --> 00:20:14,760
但这又是一次机会 我让他们明白
But this was just another opportunity for me to show them

565
00:20:14,760 --> 00:20:18,140
我不再是以前那个肤浅的歌洛莉亚
that I was not the superficial Gloria that I used to be.

566
00:20:18,300 --> 00:20:21,880
而且 今天享受后我很放松
Plus I was very relaxed after the day I had.

567
00:20:27,380 --> 00:20:28,320
你在哪里
Where are you?

568
00:20:28,560 --> 00:20:31,020
在看医生 他在检查我的脚踝
At the doctor. He's checking my ankle.

569
00:20:31,420 --> 00:20:35,040
怎样 你觉得我会把全天SPA享受就这样扔掉吗
What? Did you think I was gonna throw away a whole spa day?

570
00:20:38,740 --> 00:20:40,600
妈妈来了 弗汉希欧
I'm coming, Fulgencio!

571
00:20:48,380 --> 00:20:49,600
我为什么要这样做
Why am I doing this again?

572
00:20:49,600 --> 00:20:51,140
老爸会很开心的
Dad'll get a kick out of it.

573
00:20:51,140 --> 00:20:53,060
就像我们小时候那样 经常穿他的鞋子
Like when we were young and used to wear his shoes.

574
00:20:53,500 --> 00:20:55,120
现在起来走几步
Now get up and take a few steps.

575
00:21:01,020 --> 00:21:02,720
这是老爸要求的吗
Did dad ask for this?

576
00:21:02,720 --> 00:21:05,149
不 不过他会喜欢的 跳下舞吧
No, but he'll love it. Maybe dance around.

577
00:21:08,880 --> 00:21:10,020
好吧 跳起来
Okay, now jump.

578
00:21:11,160 --> 00:21:12,700
这算哪门子的视频啊
What kind of video is this?

579
00:21:12,740 --> 00:21:14,300
知道吗 我要上班了 抱歉
You know what? I've gotta go to work. I'm sorry.

580
00:21:14,700 --> 00:21:15,540
谢了
Okay, thanks!

581
00:21:16,020 --> 00:21:16,960
怎么不摔跟头了
What the hell?

582
00:21:23,300 --> 00:21:23,860
终于摔了
Finally!
